<p>Improve your predation by learning from past hunts. You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.18, 0.52, 0.78, 1.01, 1.20</acronym> accuracy and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.09, 0.26, 0.39, 0.50, 0.60</acronym> armor penetration against foes for each foe of that type you have previously slain, to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 26, 39, 50, 60</acronym> accuracy and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 13, 19, 25, 30</acronym> apr.</p>